# Unit Tests

Colocate each unit test with the source file it tests. Name the test by
appending `.spec` before the source file extension:

- `thing.ts` → `thing.spec.ts`
- `Component.tsx` → `Component.spec.tsx`

Keep the test in the same directory as its source file. Do not place unit
tests in a separate test directory or use a different suffix.
